0	section	Starting out
1	line	Father Aereck	Welcome to the church of holy Saradomin.
1	select	Select an option
1	option	Who's Saradomin?
1	option	Nice place you've got here.
1	option	I'm looking for a quest!
2	line	Player	I'm looking for a quest.
2	line	Father Aereck	That's lucky, I need someone to do a quest for me.
2	select	Start The Restless Ghost quest?
2	option	Yes
3	line	Player	Okay, let me help then.
3	line	Father Aereck	Thank you. The problem is, there is a ghost in the church graveyard. I would like you to get rid of it.
3	line	Father Aereck	If you need any help, my friend Father Urhney is an expert on ghosts.
3	line	Father Aereck	I believe he is currently living as a hermit in Lumbridge swamp. He has a little shack in the far west of the swamps.
3	line	Father Aereck	Exit the graveyard through the south gate to reach the swamp. I'm sure if you told him that I sent you he'd be willing to help.
3	line	Father Aereck	My name is Father Aereck by the way. Pleased to meet you.
3	line	Player	Likewise.
2	line	Father Aereck	Take care travelling through the swamps, I have heard they can be quite dangerous.
3	line	Player	I will, thanks.
3	action	end
2	option	No
3	line	Player	Sorry, I don't have time right now.
3	line	Father Aereck	Oh well. If you do have some spare time on your hands, come back and talk to me.
3	action	end
0	section	Talking to Father Aereck again
1	line	Father Aereck	Have you got rid of the ghost yet?
1	line	Player	I can't find Father Urhney at the moment.
1	line	Father Aereck	Well, you can get to the swamp he lives in by going south through the cemetery.
1	line	Father Aereck	You'll have to go right into the far western depths of the swamp, near the coastline. That is where his house is.
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to Father Urhney
1	line	Father Urhney	Go away! I'm meditating!
1	select	Select an option
1	option	Well, that's friendly.
2	line	Player	Well, that's friendly.
2	line	Father Urhney	I SAID go AWAY.
2	line	Player	Okay, okay... sheesh, what a grouch.
2	action	end
1	option	Father Aereck sent me to talk to you.
2	line	Player	Father Aereck sent me to talk to you.
2	line	Father Urhney	I suppose I'd better talk to you then. What problems has he got himself into this time?
2	select	Select an option
2	option	He's got a ghost haunting his graveyard.
3	line	Player	He's got a ghost haunting his graveyard.
3	line	Father Urhney	Oh, the silly fool.
3	line	Father Urhney	I leave town for just five months, and ALREADY he can't manage.
3	line	Father Urhney	(sigh)
3	line	Father Urhney	Well, I can't go back and exorcise it. I vowed not to leave this place. Until I had done a full two years of prayer and meditation.
3	line	Father Urhney	Tell you what I can do though; take this amulet.
2	box	Father Urhney hands you an amulet.
3	line	Father Urhney	It is an Amulet of Ghostspeak.
3	line	Father Urhney	So called, because when you wear it you can speak to ghosts. A lot of ghosts are doomed to be ghosts because they have left some important task uncompleted.
3	line	Father Urhney	Maybe if you know what this task is, you can get rid of the ghost. I'm not making any guarantees mind you, but it is the best I can do right now.
3	line	Player	Thank you. I'll give it a try!
3	action	end
2	option	You mean he gets himself into lots of problems?
3	line	Player	You mean he gets himself into lots of problems?
3	line	Father Urhney	Yeah. For example, when we were trainee priests he kept on getting stuck up bell ropes.
3	line	Father Urhney	Anyway. I don't have time for chitchat. What's his problem THIS time?
3	line	Player	He's got a ghost haunting his graveyard.
3	action	above
1	option	I've come to repossess your house.
2	line	Player	I've come to repossess your house.
2	line	Father Urhney	Under what grounds???
2	select	Select an option
2	option	Repeated failure on mortgage repayments.
3	line	Player	Repeated failure on mortgage repayments.
3	line	Father Urhney	What?
3	line	Father Urhney	But... I don't have a mortgage! I built this house myself!
3	line	Player	Sorry. I must have got the wrong address. All the houses look the same around here.
3	line	Father Urhney	What? What houses? What ARE you talking about???
3	line	Player	Never mind.
3	action	end
2	option	I don't know. I just wanted this house.
3	line	Player	I don't know. I just wanted this house...
3	line	Father Urhney	Oh... go away and stop wasting my time!
3	action	end
