0	section	While wearing the Amulet of Ghostspeak
1	line	Player	Hello ghost, how are you?
1	line	Restless ghost	Not very good actually.
1	line	Player	What's the problem then?
1	line	Restless ghost	Did you just understand what I said???
1	select	Select an option
1	option	Yep, now tell me what the problem is.
2	line	Player	Yep, now tell me what the problem is.
2	line	Restless ghost	WOW! This is INCREDIBLE! I didn't expect anyone to ever understand me again!
2	line	Player	Ok, Ok, I can understand you!
2	line	Player	But have you any idea WHY you're doomed to be a ghost?
2	line	Restless ghost	Well, to be honest... I'm not sure.
2	line	Player	I've been told a certain task may need to be completed so you can rest in peace.
2	line	Restless ghost	I should think it is probably because a warlock has come along and stolen my skull. If you look inside my coffin there, you'll find my corpse without a head on it.
2	line	Player	Do you know where this warlock might be now?
2	line	Restless ghost	I think it was one of the warlocks who lives in the big tower by the sea south-west from here.
2	line	Player	Ok. I will try and get the skull back for you, then you can rest in peace.
2	line	Restless ghost	Ooh, thank you. That would be such a great relief!
2	line	Restless ghost	It is so dull being a ghost...
2	action	end
